WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.773
Hi, I'm Sarah from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:02.813 --> 00:00:07.306
Installing takes about a minute —
and your browser may warn you first.

3
00:00:07.346 --> 00:00:09.054
Here's why, and what to do.

4
00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:11.478
Click Download.

5
00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:14.628
Because A9 Voice is new
and not code-signed yet,

6
00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:17.778
Edge may say the file
isn't commonly downloaded.

7
00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:21.466
Open the three dots next
to it and choose Keep.

8
00:00:21.506 --> 00:00:22.694
Edge asks once more

9
00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:26.574
click the arrow on the Delete
button and choose Keep anyway.

10
00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:31.357
If Windows also shows a blue
“protected your PC” box,

11
00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.928
click More info, then Run anyway.

12
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.861
Then open the file.

13
00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:38.120
The installer takes a few clicks.

14
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.242
When it's done, A9 Voice opens.

15
00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:42.638
No account, nothing to sign up for.

16
00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:46.456
Want to double-check?

17
00:00:46.496 --> 00:00:50.201
The download page lists the
file's SHA-256 fingerprint,

18
00:00:50.241 --> 00:00:52.311
and every release is on GitHub.

19
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.456
That's it.

20
00:00:54.496 --> 00:00:56.683
Hold your key and start talking.
